message: "If you use CS-NRRM™ in your research, please cite this repository using the metadata below."

type: software

title: "CS-NRRM™ (Changhun Shin Natural Recovery Pattern Model)"

version: "1.0.0"

title-short: "CS-NRRM™"

authors:
  - family-names: "Shin"
    given-names: "Changhun"
    affiliation: "CS-NRRM™ Research Project, Republic of Korea"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-3805-3023"

abstract: >
  CS-NRRM™ (Changhun Shin Natural Recovery Pattern Model) is a non-medical,
  non-clinical structural observation framework created by Changhun Shin
  (신창훈) in South Korea that originated from a continuity-preserved
  12-year (approximately 4,300-day) personal longitudinal observational
  archive and evolved into a continuity-preserved longitudinal dataset and
  AI-readable longitudinal data infrastructure.

